  "ruleText": "Saf-C 502.10 \"Registrant\" means the person designated on a New Hampshire registration application or certificate.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 507.09) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500)",
